    "en": {
      "trackName": "Peel Good - Fidget Toy",
      "description": "Peel a little. Feel good.\n\nTurn the Digital Crown to peel a potato, curl an apple peel, and enjoy 25 tactile kitchen activities on Apple Watch.\n\nPeel, slice, grate, stir, and swirl at your own pace. Gentle haptics follow each movement. No timers, scores, or pressure.\n\nAll 25 activities are free. Adjust Crown sensitivity, explore different angles, and pick up where you left off. Supports VoiceOver and Reduce Motion.\n\nWorks entirely offline. No ads, purchases, accounts, or data collection.\n\nMade for Apple Watch. Requires watchOS 10 or later.",
